TITLE

*Set the defaults for precision simulations
DEFAULTS                                                              PRECISIO
*Define the beam characteristics
BEAM                                                                  ISOTOPE
RADDECAY           2
HI-PROPE          38        90       0.0
*Define the beam position
BEAMPOS            0         0         0
BEAMPOS            0        10         0        10         0      0.01CART-VOL
GEOBEGIN                                                              COMBNAME
    0    0          
RPP blk_b      -50 50 -50 50 -50 50
RPP air_b      -40 40 -40 40 -0.005 40
RPP src_b      -5 5 -5 5 -0.005 0.005
RPP al_b       -5 5 -5 5 5.00 5.05
RPP pmma_b     -5 5 -5 5 5.05 6.05
END
*Black hole
BLKBODY      5 +blk_b -air_b
*Void around
VOID         5 +air_b -src_b -al_b -pmma_b
*Void around
ZRODLO       5 +src_b
*Void around
OSLONA       5 +al_b
*Void around
VOID1        5 +pmma_b
END
GEOEND
*..+....1....+....2....+....3....+....4....+....5....+....6....+....7..
ASSIGNMA    BLCKHOLE   BLKBODY
ASSIGNMA      VACUUM      VOID
ASSIGNMA      COPPER    TARGET
*Requests simulation of radioactive decays and sets the corresponding
*biasing and transport conditions
RADDECAY          1.
*Define an irradiation profile for radioactive decay calculations
IRRPROFI
*Defines decay times for radioactive product scoring
DCYTIMES
*Associates selected scoring detectors with user-defined decay times
DCYSCORE
DCYSCORE          -1
*Set the random number seed
RANDOMIZ         1.0
*Set the number of primary histories to be simulated in the run
START
STOP
